## Usage

```bash
# Install Doxygen
sudo apt-get install doxygen

# Generate documentation
doxygen docs/doxygen/Doxyfile

# View documentation
xdg-open docs/doxygen/html/index.html
```

## API Documentation Structure

```
docs/doxygen/
├── html/
│   ├── index.html
│   ├── modules.html
│   ├── classes.html
│   ├── files.html
│   ├── namespaces.html
│   └── ...
└── latex/
    ├── refman.tex
    └── ...
```

## Documentation Categories

### 1. Core Modules

- **PageParser**: InnoDB page parsing
- **PageReader**: Page checksum validation
- **BPlusTreeParser**: B+Tree index parsing
- **SchemaDefs**: Table schema definitions

### 2. Recovery Modules

- **RecoveryEngine**: Unified recovery entry point
- **BlobReconstructor**: BLOB data reconstruction
- **DiskScanner**: Disk scanning for lost data

### 3. Export Modules

- **CSVExporter**: CSV format export
- **SQLExporter**: SQL format export
- **IBDExporter**: IBD format export

### 4. Utility Modules

- **CliParser**: Command-line argument parsing
- **FileMapper**: File memory mapping
- **Logger**: Logging utilities

## Documentation Standards

### Comment Style

```cpp
/**
 * @brief Brief description
 * 
 * Detailed description
 * 
 * @param param1 Description of param1
 * @param param2 Description of param2
 * @return Description of return value
 * @throws ExceptionType Description of exception
 */
```

### Class Documentation

```cpp
/**
 * @class ClassName
 * @brief Brief class description
 * 
 * Detailed class description
 * 
 * This class provides ... functionality.
 * 
 * @example
 * @code
 * ClassName obj;
 * obj.method();
 * @endcode
 */
```

### Function Documentation

```cpp
/**
 * @brief Brief function description
 * 
 * Detailed function description
 * 
 * @param param1 Description of first parameter
 * @param param2 Description of second parameter
 * @return Description of return value
 * @throws std::runtime_error Description of exception
 * @see RelatedFunction
 * @note Additional notes
 */
```

